    {
      "name": "places/ChIJrzcgeE71aS4Rkf1623n4WPE/reviews/ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNGLVpUUFRREAE",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "2 years ago",
      "rating": 2,
      "text": {
        "text": "First time visiting, ambience is ok... but the problem was very Slow service... we had to wait over 40 mins to be delivered 4 beverages to our table, and that was after asking 3 times to the waiters about what took so long. The table next to mine sat down 10 min after we had been seated, and they got their beverages before we did. The waiters tried to handle the problem but were too slow... i dont know who is responsible but i tell u I am not fond of slow service coffee shops. I dont think i will be visiting this place again.",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
      "originalText": {
